An electricity department wants to automate monthly billing.

A customer provides the total number of units consumed in a month.

The billing rules are:

For the first 100 units, charge ₹2 per unit.

For units between 101 and 300, charge ₹4 per unit.

For units above 300, charge ₹6 per unit.

After calculating the total bill:

If the total amount exceeds ₹2000, apply a 10% surcharge on the total bill.

Write a program to calculate and display the final electricity bill amount.
