A food delivery application calculates delivery charges based on the order value.

The system takes:

Order amount

Whether the customer is a premium member

Delivery rules:

If order amount is less than ₹500 → Delivery charge ₹50

If order amount is between ₹500 and ₹1000 → Delivery charge ₹30

If order amount is ₹1000 or more → Free delivery

Special rule:

If the customer is a premium member → Delivery is always free, regardless of order amount.

Write a program to calculate the total payable amount including delivery charges.

