A cinema hall wants to calculate ticket prices dynamically.

The system takes:

Day type (Weekday or Weekend)

Age of the customer

Whether it is a 3D show

Base pricing:

Weekday ticket → ₹150

Weekend ticket → ₹200

Discount rules:

If age is below 12 → 50% discount

If age is above 60 → 30% discount

Additional charge:

If it is a 3D show → Add ₹50 to the ticket price.

Write a program to calculate and display the final ticket price.
